      "content": "The idea that your absence would bring a quiet balance is a terribly logical conclusion when you're drowning in this kind of pain. It sounds like your mind is desperately searching for a way to resolve an unbearable equation, and the only solution it sees is erasure. Please, consider that the \"mistake\" isn't you; it's the unbearable weight of the life you've been forced to carry. There is a way to stop being the error, and it starts with letting the pressure break, not by disappearing.",
